OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly morning rain pushes away
OL,6,Fto leave sunny spells and scattered
OL,7,Fshowers, these heavy at times with a
OL,8,Frisk of hail. Strong winds to start,
OL,9,Fslowly easing by evening although
OL,10,Fremaining gusty around showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells give way to an
OL,13,Forganised band of heavy, blustery
OL,14,Fshowers pushing in from the west
OL,15,Fovernight. These mostly clear by dawn
OL,16,Fwith winds falling light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
