OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry start with sunny
OL,6,Fspells before Storm Austen pushes in
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest during the
OL,8,Fafternoon. This brings wet and windy
OL,9,Fweather, reaching gale force at coasts
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStorm
OL,13,FAusten continues affecting the region
OL,14,Ffor most of Friday, clearing to
OL,15,Fscattered showers by evening. Further
OL,16,Frain and wind likely Saturday ahead of
OL,17,Fa drier interlude on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
